WEBVTT

00:00:34.550 --> 00:00:36.180
I'm going!

00:00:36.180 --> 00:00:37.830
Be careful, okay?

00:00:37.830 --> 00:00:39.180
I will!

00:00:39.180 --> 00:00:41.060
Sakura-chan, good morning!

00:00:41.060 --> 00:00:42.420
Good morning!

00:00:42.930 --> 00:00:45.900
Masaki! You'll be late!

00:00:46.210 --> 00:00:47.900
Masaki!

00:00:47.900 --> 00:00:49.420
I'm up. I'm up.

00:01:14.470 --> 00:01:18.970
Let's Go Surfing!!

00:01:19.220 --> 00:01:25.270
Wave 5 Beyond That Wave

00:01:24.850 --> 00:01:26.560
Sorry, Isokichi.

00:01:26.560 --> 00:01:28.980
I'll take you for a walk 
after I get back from school.

00:01:32.260 --> 00:01:33.670
I'm going!

00:01:34.310 --> 00:01:35.950
Came back safe!

00:02:07.910 --> 00:02:09.020
Safe.

00:02:09.020 --> 00:02:11.520
Nope. You're just barely out.

00:02:11.520 --> 00:02:13.300
No one asked you.

00:02:13.760 --> 00:02:15.530
Good morning!

00:02:15.530 --> 00:02:17.750
Good morning!

00:02:17.750 --> 00:02:19.280
I'll take attendance.

00:02:19.900 --> 00:02:20.930
Aikawa.

00:02:20.930 --> 00:02:21.910
Here!

00:02:22.320 --> 00:02:23.280
Akikawa.

00:02:23.280 --> 00:02:24.680
Here.

00:02:25.340 --> 00:02:26.310
Ishigure.

00:02:26.310 --> 00:02:27.330
Here.

00:02:27.710 --> 00:02:28.560
Ogawa.

00:02:28.560 --> 00:02:29.540
Here!

00:02:30.560 --> 00:02:31.430
Kato.

00:02:31.430 --> 00:02:32.620
Here.

00:02:32.620 --> 00:02:33.460
Kida.

00:02:33.460 --> 00:02:34.340
Here!

00:02:34.340 --> 00:02:35.390
Sano.

00:02:35.390 --> 00:02:36.840
Here.

00:02:38.290 --> 00:02:40.690
This grammar will be on the test.

00:02:40.690 --> 00:02:42.870
Make sure you take good notes.

00:02:46.850 --> 00:02:48.800
Want to stop by that place on the way home?

00:02:48.800 --> 00:02:50.850
Sounds good! Let's go!

00:02:58.140 --> 00:02:59.360
Wait for me!

00:02:59.360 --> 00:03:02.360
What are you doing? Hurry up!

00:03:02.360 --> 00:03:04.870
Let's go! Hurry up!

00:03:07.370 --> 00:03:11.840
Hurry up! Let's go! To Fantasy Island!

00:03:54.320 --> 00:03:56.960
Isokichi, there's no need to rush.

00:04:02.360 --> 00:04:05.580
Isokichi. Let's head 
toward the middle school.

00:04:07.690 --> 00:04:09.390
Okay, Isokichi?

00:04:13.600 --> 00:04:15.070
I said, "no"!

00:04:16.110 --> 00:04:17.730
Isokichi! Stop!

00:04:26.110 --> 00:04:27.900
Hey, Isokichi!

00:04:41.760 --> 00:04:42.630
Ow!

00:04:43.230 --> 00:04:46.140
You're not gonna ride? 
There are some nice waves.

00:04:49.890 --> 00:04:53.390
You're right. Those are good waves.

00:04:53.850 --> 00:04:55.640
Good conditions.

00:04:55.640 --> 00:04:57.630
What are you talking about?

00:04:58.270 --> 00:04:59.760
Let's get wet!

00:05:16.870 --> 00:05:17.960
Now!

00:05:37.420 --> 00:05:39.310
Come on. Let's go.

00:05:40.740 --> 00:05:41.770
Come on.

00:06:47.260 --> 00:06:50.030
Hey, you. Show a little restraint!

00:06:50.030 --> 00:06:51.540
It's all right.

00:08:55.310 --> 00:08:58.180
I... don't need this anymore...

00:09:08.100 --> 00:09:12.190
I wish I'd never... started surfing.

00:09:12.960 --> 00:09:16.040
Then... I...

00:09:20.340 --> 00:09:23.220
I would never have to feel... like this...

00:09:31.200 --> 00:09:32.480
<i>Sho...</i>

00:09:42.630 --> 00:09:43.800
Masaki.

00:10:05.890 --> 00:10:08.250
Doesn't look like you're 
dressed for surfing.

00:10:11.850 --> 00:10:15.420
I hate... surfing.

00:10:18.110 --> 00:10:19.920
Hey, Tanaka.

00:10:21.460 --> 00:10:23.810
I don't understand.

00:10:23.810 --> 00:10:28.540
Why did Sho... go out in that stormy sea?

00:10:29.760 --> 00:10:33.050
Sho scolded me so much. So why would he...

00:10:34.980 --> 00:10:37.460
What was he thinking?

00:10:38.650 --> 00:10:40.720
Do you think something happened?

00:10:42.510 --> 00:10:43.940
If something happened,

00:10:43.940 --> 00:10:48.940
then why didn't he come 
to me... come to us for help?

00:10:50.740 --> 00:10:52.990
I mean, even if he had...

00:10:52.990 --> 00:10:55.700
we might not have been 
able to do anything...

00:10:55.700 --> 00:10:56.820
But...

00:10:59.240 --> 00:11:02.900
What was I to Sho?

00:11:05.190 --> 00:11:08.680
I... I hate surfing.

00:11:09.190 --> 00:11:12.620
It took Sho away, but...

00:11:12.620 --> 00:11:15.000
I just can't hate surfing!

00:11:17.050 --> 00:11:20.320
I hate it, but... I love it.

00:11:21.020 --> 00:11:24.600
Before I know it, 
I'm thinking about surfing.

00:11:24.600 --> 00:11:28.260
I don't know what I should be doing.

00:11:28.260 --> 00:11:29.830
I just don't know!

00:11:35.100 --> 00:11:36.840
I'm the same.

00:11:39.500 --> 00:11:40.840
Tanaka...

00:11:41.260 --> 00:11:43.490
Surfing took Sho away.

00:11:44.210 --> 00:11:48.070
But the thing that brought us 
together was surfing, too.

00:11:50.090 --> 00:11:53.610
Sho told us, right? It's all one ocean.

00:11:53.610 --> 00:11:56.350
Even if we can't see each other, 
we won't be lonely.

00:11:56.990 --> 00:12:00.260
That's why I'm not going to quit surfing.

00:12:00.700 --> 00:12:02.940
The ocean will tell me.

00:12:02.940 --> 00:12:06.670
When I'm riding the waves, I can feel Sho.

00:12:07.780 --> 00:12:09.040
Tanaka...

00:12:09.620 --> 00:12:12.630
So, don't say you're going to quit.

00:12:13.560 --> 00:12:15.180
You'll make Sho sad.

00:12:37.490 --> 00:12:39.650
Everyone came.

00:12:47.070 --> 00:12:49.330
We heard you, Masaki.

00:12:49.330 --> 00:12:52.450
This kind of thing might not be so bad.

00:12:54.210 --> 00:12:55.700
And me.

00:12:55.700 --> 00:12:58.210
You wouldn't leave me out, would you?

00:12:58.210 --> 00:13:01.430
Because we feel the same way.

00:13:01.430 --> 00:13:04.090
I can't say that I hate that kind of thing.

00:13:04.090 --> 00:13:06.480
Looks like you're doing something fun.

00:13:07.220 --> 00:13:07.970
Masaki.

00:13:07.970 --> 00:13:08.720
Masaki.

00:13:08.720 --> 00:13:09.470
Masaki.

00:13:09.470 --> 00:13:10.220
Masaki.

00:13:10.220 --> 00:13:10.970
Masaki.

00:13:10.970 --> 00:13:11.720
Masaki.

00:13:11.720 --> 00:13:14.460
In that case, let's all do this!

00:13:14.460 --> 00:13:15.730
Yeah.

00:13:15.730 --> 00:13:16.590
Yeah!

00:13:16.590 --> 00:13:18.220
Just like Sally!

00:13:20.510 --> 00:13:23.190
They're here for Sho-kun.

00:14:13.930 --> 00:14:15.250
That's...

00:14:19.870 --> 00:14:21.050
That's Sho's...

00:14:25.470 --> 00:14:26.360
Yeah.

00:14:37.320 --> 00:14:38.500
We should go, too.

00:14:39.910 --> 00:14:40.780
Yeah.

00:14:49.790 --> 00:14:51.370
Big Brother...

00:14:52.360 --> 00:14:54.140
He'll be fine now.

00:14:54.140 --> 00:14:55.110
What?

00:14:55.110 --> 00:14:57.380
After all, Masaki-kun is...

00:14:57.380 --> 00:14:59.410
He's a surfer.

00:15:05.570 --> 00:15:06.950
Go!

00:15:06.950 --> 00:15:08.500
Let's go!

00:15:25.440 --> 00:15:26.940
What are you doing?

00:15:26.940 --> 00:15:29.220
Honestly. Are you stupid?

00:15:29.220 --> 00:15:31.500
Do you know how worried we were?

00:15:31.500 --> 00:15:33.590
Big Brother, you really are an idiot.

00:15:34.400 --> 00:15:38.570
It wasn't just me, your little sister. 
Everyone was worried.

00:15:38.570 --> 00:15:41.540
I-I am sorry about that.

00:15:42.390 --> 00:15:43.820
Now, now...

00:15:50.470 --> 00:15:52.470
Graduates -  Fly into the future!

00:15:52.470 --> 00:15:55.470
<b>Graduates!</b>

00:15:52.470 --> 00:15:55.470
Congratulations!

00:15:55.470 --> 00:15:58.470
Oarai City Minami Middle School Graduation Certification Ceremony

00:16:18.150 --> 00:16:19.750
Big Brother!

00:16:19.750 --> 00:16:21.070
I'm coming!

00:16:23.740 --> 00:16:25.560
Are you sure only coming 
this far is all right?

00:16:25.560 --> 00:16:27.580
Are you going to be able to 
change trains okay?

00:16:28.380 --> 00:16:30.480
Stop treating me like a child.

00:16:30.480 --> 00:16:32.380
I'm in high school now.

00:16:32.380 --> 00:16:33.790
I'll be fine.

00:16:33.790 --> 00:16:36.340
If you get lost, be sure to ask
a station attendant for directions.

00:16:36.340 --> 00:16:38.870
I said, stop treating me like a child!

00:16:38.870 --> 00:16:41.640
Tanaka-kun, you're going to 
Hawaii next week, right?

00:16:41.640 --> 00:16:43.640
Are you done packing?

00:16:43.640 --> 00:16:45.580
No problem.

00:16:45.580 --> 00:16:49.510
As long as I've got my board and ukulele, 
I don't need anything else.

00:16:49.510 --> 00:16:50.900
Is that so?

00:16:50.900 --> 00:16:52.410
You're leaving already?

00:16:52.410 --> 00:16:55.070
School there doesn't start 
until August, right?

00:16:55.070 --> 00:16:58.050
I thought I'd go early 
and get used to things.

00:16:58.050 --> 00:16:58.910
Plus...

00:16:58.910 --> 00:17:01.680
You want to surf in Hawaii so bad 
you can't stand it, right?

00:17:01.680 --> 00:17:02.880
Exactly.

00:17:02.880 --> 00:17:04.620
You're the same, right?

00:17:05.290 --> 00:17:10.840
Well, Mom, Sakura, Isokichi... I'm off!

00:17:10.840 --> 00:17:13.010
Take care of your health, okay?

00:17:13.010 --> 00:17:14.840
And come home from time to time.

00:17:14.840 --> 00:17:16.710
You're making too big a deal about this.

00:17:16.710 --> 00:17:19.500
Big Brother, I'll be coming to visit you.

00:17:19.500 --> 00:17:23.770
Before I do, make sure to find some 
fancy shops and cafés and things, okay?

00:17:23.770 --> 00:17:26.240
Yeah, yeah. I will.

00:17:29.310 --> 00:17:32.320
Make sure you take Sakura for walks, okay?

00:17:32.590 --> 00:17:34.320
It's the other way around.

00:17:36.710 --> 00:17:38.830
See you, Murphy.

00:17:39.620 --> 00:17:42.330
Good luck, Corgi.

00:18:26.810 --> 00:18:28.570
Um...

00:18:29.140 --> 00:18:30.150
This way!

00:18:37.200 --> 00:18:38.500
Almost there.

00:18:38.500 --> 00:18:39.800
<i>Thank you for waiting.</i>

00:18:39.800 --> 00:18:44.140
<i>Thank you for choosing to ride 
with Enoshima Electric Railway today.</i>

00:18:44.950 --> 00:18:46.330
<i>April.</i>

00:18:46.330 --> 00:18:51.170
<i>I'd decided to go the high school Kosuke-san 
and Yuta had invited me to in Shonan.</i>

00:18:51.830 --> 00:18:55.600
<i>I'd be boarding with a surfboard 
shaper they'd introduced me to.</i>

00:18:58.350 --> 00:19:02.410
Surfing will change everything...

00:19:02.410 --> 00:19:04.900
Masaki, you sure you just want to watch?

00:19:05.650 --> 00:19:06.910
You should come do it with us.

00:19:07.740 --> 00:19:10.190
Sho. I told you, didn't I?

00:19:10.190 --> 00:19:11.780
Corgi and surfing are—

00:19:11.780 --> 00:19:12.790
I'll do it!

00:19:13.550 --> 00:19:15.420
Let's go surfing!

00:19:20.590 --> 00:19:22.500
Masaki! You're going!

00:19:22.800 --> 00:19:23.830
Paddle!

00:19:23.830 --> 00:19:25.050
Huh? Right!

00:19:27.360 --> 00:19:29.860
One, two, three!

00:19:44.270 --> 00:19:45.240
I...

00:19:46.810 --> 00:19:48.170
I'm flying!

00:19:52.870 --> 00:19:57.360
It felt so amazing!

00:19:58.950 --> 00:20:03.190
Seriously... My life has completely changed.

00:20:03.190 --> 00:20:06.470
Who'd have thought I'd go live in Shonan?

00:20:10.680 --> 00:20:14.450
Still, this train runs 
really close to the houses.

00:20:14.450 --> 00:20:17.300
The Great Buddha statue is... where?

00:20:31.370 --> 00:20:35.420
<i>Next stop, Shichirigahama. Shichirigahama.</i>

00:20:35.790 --> 00:20:37.890
<i>The doors on your left will open.</i>

00:20:43.310 --> 00:20:44.480
Masaki!

00:20:46.360 --> 00:20:47.970
You're finally here.

00:20:48.390 --> 00:20:50.660
Yuta! Kosuke-san.

00:20:50.660 --> 00:20:52.040
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:20:52.040 --> 00:20:54.350
Here, I brought you something.

00:20:56.190 --> 00:20:57.400
Dried sweet potatoes!

00:20:57.400 --> 00:20:59.110
Oh, right.

00:20:59.460 --> 00:21:00.790
Thank you.

00:21:00.790 --> 00:21:03.530
Okay, I'll show you the way 
to your boarding house.

00:21:03.530 --> 00:21:05.190
Tadao-san is waiting, too.

00:21:06.820 --> 00:21:08.330
All your luggage arrived.

00:21:08.330 --> 00:21:09.740
Thanks.

00:21:21.980 --> 00:21:23.260
Masaki?

00:21:24.240 --> 00:21:28.340
It seems there's something he wants to do 
before heading to Tadao House.

00:21:28.780 --> 00:21:30.400
It's only natural.

00:21:30.400 --> 00:21:32.600
Since he's come to Shonan...

00:21:32.930 --> 00:21:35.680
Let's go surfing!

00:21:45.740 --> 00:21:47.550
This feels amazing!

00:21:50.450 --> 00:21:53.940
<i>I'm going beyond the wave 
of sadness and moving forward.</i>

00:21:54.300 --> 00:21:56.040
<i>I'll ride a wave to the future.</i>

00:21:56.730 --> 00:22:00.050
<i>If I ride the waves, I can feel Sho.</i>

00:22:00.960 --> 00:22:03.540
<i>Sho and I promised to aim for the world.</i>

00:22:04.080 --> 00:22:06.330
<i>That's what I swore back then.</i>

00:22:06.330 --> 00:22:08.930
<i>That I'd overcome any wave, and go beyond!</i>

00:22:09.970 --> 00:22:12.560
<i>The show must go on!</i>

00:23:48.990 --> 00:23:54.010
Wave 6       Shonan Magic!
